{{wikipedia|Feeder (disambiguation)}}
==English==

===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|iːdə(r)}}

===Etymology===
[[feed]] + [[-er]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# That which [[feed]]s.
# That which is used to [[feed]].
#: Example: a bird '''feeder'''
# A [[tributary]] [[stream]], especially of a [[canal]].
# A [[branch line]] of a [[railway]]
# A [[transmission]] [[line]] that feeds the electricity for an [[electricity]] [[substation]], or for a [[transmitter]].
# {{baseball}} {{slang}} an 1800s baseball term meaning the [[pitcher]].
# {{video games|derogatory}} A player who is killed by the opposing player or team more than once through lack of skills and experience, thus helping the opposing side.
#: ''Stop '''feeding'''! You '''feeder'''.''

